                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "<b>This is important information about your Medicare Part D prescription drug coverage.</b><br/> <b>Read this notice carefully.</b> For help, please contact us. Please see ways to contacts us on the last page under \u201cFor More Information and Help with This Notice.\u201d",
