            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "On <font backColor=\"#FFFF00\">&lbrack;date_of_initial_notice&rbrack;</font>, we told you that we planned to limit your access to prescription <font backColor=\"#FFFF00\">&lbrack;applied_limitation_class&rbrack;</font> through our drug management program. After completing our review, we have determined that your use of these drugs is unsafe.",
                    "text_style": {
                        "backColor": "#FFFFBB",
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "<b>What Action Have We Taken?</b>",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphHeaderText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "Effective <font backColor=\"#FFFF00\">&lbrack;applied_limitation.start_date&rbrack;</font> and continuing until <font backColor=\"#FFFF00\">&lbrack;applied_limitation.end_date&rbrack;</font>, your access to medications is limited in the following way(s):",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
