            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "We will not cover these medications at the pharmacy when they are prescribed to you by other prescribers <font backColor=\"#FFFF00\">even if the other prescriber is in our network</font>. You can ask us to use a different prescriber by contacting us or by filling out the form at the end of this notice.",
                    "text_style": {
